{"path":"thread/promise/operator=","title":"std::promise<R>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::promise&lt;R&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/promise/operator=","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">promise<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> promise<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">promise<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> promise<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> delete<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Assigns the contents.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Move assignment operator. First, abandons the shared state (as in <span class=\"t-lc\">~promise()</span>), then assigns the shared state of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> as if by executing <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/promise\"><span class=\"kw2200\">std::<span class=\"me2\">promise</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>other<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code>promise</code> is not copy-assignable.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another <code>promise</code> to acquire the state from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/promise","title":"std::promise"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::promise<R>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Assigns the contents."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":65,"codeBlockCount":0}
